<div id="m-0b75ba15-6b08-8219-b2c7-ab8a5d6bab33" data-section-uuid="0b75ba15-6b08-8219-b2c7-ab8a5d6bab33" class="msg msg--claude">

## <span class="msg-author">claude-opus-4-7</span> <time class="msg-ts" datetime="2369-04-15T08:30:45+00:00" title="2369-04-15 08:30:45 UTC">Tue Apr 15th, 2369 at 08:30</time>

The readout shows elevated isoboramine (62 ng/mL; reference 35–40) and depressed serotonin uptake. Consistent with early-stage Vulcan neuro-pressure deficit. Recommend mind-meld therapy at 24h intervals.

</div>


